  "description": "A 1 second walk cycle that covers 1.4 m. The root bone moves 1.4 m along Z over the loop and root motion is enabled, so a character driven by it (instead of by the pose) advances at 1.4 m/s. Footstep notifies carry a typed payload (the FootstepPayload schema) and the FootPlant curve is 1 while a foot is down."
